Also sync across tabs? Could add a `storage` event listener — nice bonus but not required. Keep it focused; maybe add it since it's small. I'll skip extra features to keep code tight; the ask is persist + restore. Actually a `storage` listener is genuinely useful and ~6 lines... I'll keep scope minimal per the request. No.

